name: Historical context guidance, missing-reference recovery and exact report export
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_goal_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: threats models
require-live-snap: 25 b baseline | history
keys: Home Enter
require-live-snap: 25 RECORDED GOAL GUIDANCE | historical-context
expect: Original architecture priorities
expect: exact revision 1
expect: Model use is not independently verified
expect-not: Later replacement goal
ask: Does the historical reader distinguish the saved goal from source evidence and unverified model use while keeping the other context active?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: goal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: goal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: goal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: goal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: goal-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: goal-page-5-40x12
ask: Can the exact goal and its qualification be read through ordinary paging at all six sizes with visible return controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home Tab
require-live-snap: 20 COMPLETE DOCUMENT | complete-document
expect: Original architecture priorities
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_goal_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 RECORDED GOAL GUIDANCE · unavailable | missing-goal
expect: No current goal was substituted
expect-not: Original architecture priorities
expect-not: Later replacement goal
ask: Does a missing goal retain the exact context document and readable cause without selecting the current goal or hiding the context?
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_goal_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Original architecture priorities | recovered-goal
keys: Escape
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | draft-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | study-contexts
keys: Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Original architecture priorities | inspected-study-context
expect: Model use is not independently
expect: verified by this read
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Complete selected context document | raw-study-context
expect: Original architecture priorities
keys: Escape Escape
submit: campaign goal-reader
require-live-snap: 25 CAMPAIGN goal-reader | selected-study
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | frozen-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 2 | report
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Original architecture priorities | report-guidance
expect: Model use is not independently verified
expect-not: Later replacement goal
resize: 160x48
keys: End
live-snap: report-guidance-160x48
resize: 96x89
keys: End
live-snap: report-guidance-96x89
resize: 80x24
keys: End
live-snap: report-guidance-80x24
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-guidance-page-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: End
live-snap: report-guidance-60x20
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-guidance-page-1-60x20
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-guidance-page-2-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-12-40x12
ask: Does the matrix report keep each case's goal or explicit omission readable at all six sizes, with complete compact paging and six jobs still unstarted?
resize: 120x36
keys: j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_goal_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: threats models
require-live-snap: 25 b baseline | restarted-history
keys: Home Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Original architecture priorities | restarted-guidance
expect: exact revision 1
expect-not: Later replacement goal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_goal_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain exact context, goal and report history with six unstarted jobs, unchanged source and no provider reservations?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
